      ":question/problem": "Find the entry ${e}_{53}$ of the matrix $E$, where \n\n$$\nE=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -2 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 3 & -8 & -2 & 5 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 5 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 6 & -6 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 4 & 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n${e}_{53}=$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The entry ${e}_{53}$ lies at the intersection of the $5$th row and $3$rd column. Therefore, ${e}_{53}=2.$\n\n$$\nE=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -2 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 3 & -8 & -2 & 5 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 5 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 6 & -6 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 4 & 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"
