      ":question/problem": "Find the entry ${f}_{32}$ of the matrix $F$, where \n\n$$\nF=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 & -2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n${f}_{32}=$\n{{field-1}}",
